    /// After using the struct, release the memory of its members; otherwise, resource leaks may occur.
    ///
    ///
    /// Required Permissions: ohos.permission.ACCESS_DDK_USB
    /// # Arguments
    ///
    /// * `nonRootHub` - Returns the list of queried non-root hubs.
